TM plugin TODO
==============

Re-validate migration.py against upstream releases
----------------------------------------------------
virtaal/plugins/migration.py's Lokalize import broke silently over time
purely from KDE/Lokalize moving on - wrong config/TM paths (pre-KDE4
~/.kde/... locations, superseded by XDG base dirs ~2014) and a schema
that had since been normalized across multiple tables. Worth periodically
re-checking its assumptions (paths, file formats, DB schemas) against
each app's current source, the same way this got fixed:
  - Poedit: https://github.com/vslavik/poedit (src/tm/*)
  - Lokalize: https://invent.kde.org/sdk/lokalize (src/tm/*)
  - KBabel: dead since ~2008, superseded by Lokalize in KDE4 - nothing to
    check, just confirm it's still dead.

No fixed cadence agreed yet - these apps don't release often enough to
need checking every virtaal release, but drift silently enough (no
loud failure, just a plugin that quietly migrates nothing) that it's
worth a deliberate look now and then rather than waiting for a bug
report.
